# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PostWave AI — npm configuration
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# npm v11.16+ and v12 block dependency install scripts (preinstall / install /
# postinstall) unless they are explicitly approved in the `allowScripts` field of
# the package.json that owns them. The required approvals for this repo live in:
#   - frontend/package.json  -> esbuild, fsevents
#   - backend/package.json   -> @prisma/client, @prisma/engines, prisma, fsevents
#
# NOTE: `enable-pre-post-scripts` is NOT a real npm setting (it is a pnpm/yarn
# token) and does nothing here. We intentionally do NOT set `ignore-scripts=true`
# because it would silently bypass the `allowScripts` allowlist above and would
# re-introduce the "esbuild postinstall skipped" failure.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
